          "filename": "Experience Nature's Light Show in Voyageurs National Park (902bed75-1dd8-b71b-0b9f-46e49e80a936).jpg",
          "caption": "Northern lights over Voyageurs National Park\nThe dark skies of Voyageurs are the perfect backdrop for the moon, planets, and stars. Watch for meteors as they streak across the sky and you look for an appearance by the Northern Lights!\nKeywords: nps centennial; media quality",
          "alt": "Northern lights over Voyageurs National Park\nThe dark skies of Voyageurs are the perfect backdrop for the moon, planets, and stars. Watch for meteors as they streak across the sky and you look for an appearance by the Northern Lights!\nKeywords: nps centennial; media quality",
